				 <i><span class="en">
					Alex.Aphr.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					2.57
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὧραι μ.</span> 'seasons' (quarters)
				<i>of the month</i>, Antyll.l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>a month old</i>, <i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>Nu.</u>
