					<u>Mul.</u>
					2.188
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>a month long</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νύξ</span>”
