				Cleom.
				1.7
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραλλαγή, παράλλαγμα</span>,
				<i><span class="en">
				Gem.
				8.22
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				19
			</span></i>.</div>
